00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.191
Heart and blood vessel
diseases still kill more

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:51.311
people -- not only in this
country, but also

00:00:51.335 --> 00:00:53.976
worldwide -- than everything
else combined, and yet

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:56.334
it's completely preventable
for almost everybody.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.976
